WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:03.440
My name is Cloud Zeph Linhea.

00:04.110 --> 00:06.610
I am the second prince of Linhea Kingdom.

00:06.610 --> 00:07.520
Huh?!

00:08.080 --> 00:11.450
They say my mother is kept 
isolated due to her illness,

00:11.450 --> 00:14.490
but that is not the truth.

00:14.490 --> 00:16.830
My mother is being held prisoner...

00:16.830 --> 00:18.830
by Prime Minister Wardack.

00:18.830 --> 00:20.450
My goodness...

00:20.450 --> 00:23.460
King Linhea has said nothing?

00:24.050 --> 00:26.830
My father cannot go against 
Prime Minister Wardack.

00:27.120 --> 00:31.300
I think he might be killed 
if he tries to oppose him.

00:32.310 --> 00:35.590
<i>Wardack would want the first prince 
who shares his family's bloodline</i>

00:35.590 --> 00:37.770
<i>to become king as soon as possible.</i>

00:38.220 --> 00:40.430
<i>Wait, huh? Hold on a minute.</i>

00:40.890 --> 00:43.270
Do you mean this whole 
marriage proposal was...

00:43.270 --> 00:45.820
I believe he intends to have
 the prince inherit the crown

00:45.820 --> 00:48.150
once the engagement is announced.

00:49.150 --> 00:50.610
<i>Aha.</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:52.900
<i>So that's why he brought the offer to Sue.</i>

00:53.320 --> 00:57.690
<i>It's likely he chose Sue because she's a child 
who wouldn't be able to oppose him,</i>

00:57.690 --> 00:59.240
<i>which suits his plans.</i>

01:01.150 --> 01:03.870
Grand Duke of Brunhild, I have a proposal.

01:04.750 --> 01:09.960
I believe we should hold an urgent summit 
of the western nations regarding this.

01:09.960 --> 01:13.050
<i>Huh?! This issue is that grand in scale?!</i>

01:13.050 --> 01:15.400
Deposing the foolish first prince

01:15.400 --> 01:17.960
and having Prince Cloud succeed 
the throne is one option.

01:17.960 --> 01:21.010
And I believe we should offer 
our assistance to those ends.

01:23.790 --> 01:27.870
Gather up your tears

01:27.870 --> 01:30.270
And release your unhindered light

01:30.270 --> 01:35.200
That shines like a diamond

01:35.200 --> 01:36.710
Don't worry, don't care

01:36.710 --> 01:39.750
Follow your heart

01:50.540 --> 01:56.800
Every time I spoke of my
dreams, they felt closed off

01:56.800 --> 02:03.110
Even that bird and that sky
seemed monochrome to me

02:03.110 --> 02:09.560
Yet you were there in my path,
your eyes brimming with strength

02:09.560 --> 02:16.240
Time then stopped, and deep within
my heart something began to stir

02:18.310 --> 02:22.320
Don't be afraid, and run forth

02:22.320 --> 02:24.690
If we only have one life to live

02:24.690 --> 02:31.000
Then be true to yourself,
so you don't regret it

02:31.000 --> 02:35.090
Gather up your tears

02:35.090 --> 02:37.470
And release your unhindered light

02:37.470 --> 02:42.490
That shines like a diamond

02:42.490 --> 02:43.960
Don't worry, don't care

02:43.960 --> 02:47.110
Follow your heart

02:53.020 --> 02:58.030
Episode 8

02:53.020 --> 02:58.030
Two Princes and the Small Fiancée

02:59.260 --> 03:01.000
So that's the situation.

03:01.000 --> 03:03.130
I see...

03:03.130 --> 03:07.830
I find myself angered by the deeds 
of this prime minister and first prince.

03:07.830 --> 03:10.550
Having Prince Cloud succeed to 
the throne is well and good,

03:10.550 --> 03:12.810
but will the nation function 
properly after that?

03:12.810 --> 03:17.380
Do you have any influential nobles 
who seem likely to become your ally?

03:17.380 --> 03:20.150
The previous prime minister, Marquis Koupe,

03:20.150 --> 03:22.590
is well regarded by the regional nobility.

03:22.590 --> 03:25.470
He's been supporting me in 
the background where he can.

03:26.270 --> 03:28.560
If you just want me to save your mother,

03:28.560 --> 03:31.190
there's also the option 
of fleeing the country.

03:31.190 --> 03:33.740
No. I've already seen many people suffering

03:33.740 --> 03:37.550
at the hands of my brother 
and the prime minister.

03:37.550 --> 03:41.030
At the time, I was powerless 
and unable to save them.

03:42.940 --> 03:46.180
While it may be late coming,  
if there is anything I can do for them,

03:46.180 --> 03:48.040
I would like to see it done.

03:49.070 --> 03:50.750
What do you all think

03:51.070 --> 03:55.200
about Linhea—no, Prince Cloud's proposal?

03:55.200 --> 03:58.780
Our nation will support Prince Cloud.

03:58.780 --> 03:59.820
Same here.

04:04.510 --> 04:05.930
Thank you so much!

04:05.930 --> 04:10.210
That just leaves the question of how 
to overthrow the prime minister.

04:10.210 --> 04:13.140
I'd rather avoid using 
physical force if we can.

04:13.730 --> 04:15.150
Well, you know...

04:15.150 --> 04:17.280
You'll figure something out, Touya.

04:17.280 --> 04:19.110
Hey! You're dumping it all on me?!

04:23.730 --> 04:25.320
Okay, looks like it's clear.

04:27.430 --> 04:28.340
Hup.

04:29.400 --> 04:30.700
Amazing.

04:30.700 --> 04:32.600
We really got to Linhea in an instant.

04:33.010 --> 04:35.540
This invisibility magic, too...

04:35.540 --> 04:38.360
I can't tell where you are at all.

04:39.420 --> 04:41.780
Now, as we discussed earlier,

04:41.780 --> 04:45.540
I'd like you to report the 
results of the proposal.

04:45.540 --> 04:50.010
I want to see what the first prince and 
the prime minister are like for myself first.

04:53.160 --> 04:55.680
I have returned, my brother.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.640
Cloud, huh?

04:59.640 --> 05:01.870
You returned awfully soon.

05:01.870 --> 05:04.610
Quite unusual for a dullard like you.

05:05.320 --> 05:08.070
<i>So this is First Prince Zabune?</i>

05:08.660 --> 05:10.470
<i>What bad taste.</i>

05:11.740 --> 05:13.790
<i>Master, that woman's neck.</i>

05:18.790 --> 05:19.870
<i>That's...</i>

05:20.490 --> 05:22.990
So how did they respond?

05:22.990 --> 05:26.130
You got a good answer from them, of course?

05:26.130 --> 05:27.230
No...

05:27.230 --> 05:30.140
Unfortunately, they told us 
that Duke Ortlinde's daughter

05:30.140 --> 05:32.590
was already engaged to another,

05:32.590 --> 05:34.600
so they couldn't accept.

05:35.180 --> 05:38.470
What? Sorry, I didn't hear that.

05:38.470 --> 05:40.190
What did you say?

05:40.190 --> 05:43.280
I said they turned down your proposal—

05:46.110 --> 05:48.220
You're useless!

05:48.220 --> 05:52.020
You should have thought to try and 
kidnap the duke's daughter, then!

05:52.020 --> 05:55.750
Once we slap an Enslavement Collar 
on her, she'll be my slave anyway!

05:56.830 --> 06:00.000
<i>He was planning to enslave Sue?!</i>

06:00.000 --> 06:02.770
Tsk! You can't even accomplish 
such a simple task!

06:02.770 --> 06:05.180
You truly are useless!

06:05.610 --> 06:09.740
So? Who is the man the duke's 
daughter is engaged to?

06:10.460 --> 06:14.560
The Grand Duke of Brunhild 
Duchy, Mochizuki Touya.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.650
Brunhild?

06:16.650 --> 06:20.570
Oh, that upstart nation 
that was only formed recently.

06:22.390 --> 06:23.800
Hey, Cloud.

06:23.800 --> 06:27.650
Go back to Belfast and 
start spreading some rumors.

06:28.300 --> 06:29.320
Rumors?

06:29.660 --> 06:35.540
Tell people the Grand Duke of Brunhild is 
a womanizer who's left many women in tears.

06:37.450 --> 06:41.400
Then he might cancel 
their engagement, right?

06:41.400 --> 06:43.170
It's a good idea, isn't it?

06:45.320 --> 06:47.090
What is that look for?

06:50.870 --> 06:54.720
You need to learn your place, 
you lowborn scum!

06:54.720 --> 06:55.720
Touya.

06:55.250 --> 06:58.060
Do you get it yet, huh?!

06:55.720 --> 06:56.650
Yeah.

06:56.650 --> 06:58.060
Zabune?

06:58.060 --> 07:00.010
What are you doing?

07:00.440 --> 07:02.860
Oh, Mother.

07:02.860 --> 07:03.820
Well, see...

07:03.820 --> 07:07.430
I was just disciplining my 
ill-mannered younger brother.

07:07.430 --> 07:09.560
My, how kind of you!

07:09.560 --> 07:11.820
So how did the proposal go?

07:11.820 --> 07:14.990
They rejected it, thanks to Cloud.

07:14.990 --> 07:16.330
Hey, Mother.

07:16.330 --> 07:19.290
Can't I just succeed the throne 
without being engaged?

07:19.290 --> 07:20.950
We'll see.

07:20.950 --> 07:23.670
I'll talk to Wardack about it.

07:23.670 --> 07:25.630
That's the spirit!

07:30.800 --> 07:32.560
Come forth, Light!

07:32.560 --> 07:35.580
Soothing Comfort: Cure Heal!

07:37.740 --> 07:39.060
Are you all right?

07:39.060 --> 07:41.560
Yes. Thank you.

07:44.350 --> 07:46.690
I can't believe that stupid prince.

07:46.690 --> 07:50.070
I came close to trying to cut him 
down several times myself.

07:50.070 --> 07:52.330
That Enslavement Collar...

07:52.640 --> 07:56.200
My brother bought her from a merchant 
from the Kingdom of Sandora.

07:56.200 --> 08:00.040
Even though slavery is 
forbidden in our nation.

08:00.550 --> 08:02.190
That bastard.

08:03.530 --> 08:04.570
Gate.

08:06.070 --> 08:07.190
Apport.

08:11.150 --> 08:12.960
You're all right now.

08:13.960 --> 08:15.930
Hey! Someone come here!

08:17.280 --> 08:18.470
Cloud!

08:18.470 --> 08:21.020
Did my slave come by here?

08:21.020 --> 08:23.020
No, I haven't seen her.

08:23.830 --> 08:25.590
Where did she go?!

08:25.590 --> 08:28.270
What's the matter, Prince Zabune?

08:28.630 --> 08:30.050
Wardack!

08:30.050 --> 08:31.650
My slave is gone!

08:31.650 --> 08:33.490
She just disappeared!

08:36.140 --> 08:37.450
Your slave?

08:37.980 --> 08:40.160
That is Prime Minister Wardack.

08:40.160 --> 08:42.780
Have you ordered her to return?

08:42.780 --> 08:45.300
I did! But it isn't working!

08:45.300 --> 08:48.000
Then tighten the collar and kill her.

08:49.210 --> 08:52.000
You don't need that slave, right?

08:52.000 --> 08:55.060
Once her body is found, I'll deal with it.

08:55.060 --> 08:56.060
Hmph.

08:56.370 --> 08:59.810
I hadn't even started playing 
with her in earnest yet.

09:03.870 --> 09:07.500
My troubles never cease with 
such a useless younger brother.

09:07.500 --> 09:10.040
I even killed a slave to vent my anger.

09:10.540 --> 09:12.230
Argh, I'm so mad!

09:13.110 --> 09:17.530
Eventually, we'll have Prince Cloud 
go north to the Kingdom of Palouf.

09:17.530 --> 09:21.660
That country had a queen and a noble 
woman who met my tastes, didn't it?

09:22.030 --> 09:24.590
We won't be sending him 
with a marriage proposal.

09:25.660 --> 09:28.010
Prince Cloud will be...

09:30.420 --> 09:35.630
Wardack is planning to use Prince Cloud 
to declare war on the Kingdom of Palouf.

09:36.880 --> 09:40.260
Would you normally have a second 
prince declare war for you?

09:40.260 --> 09:43.620
On the surface, he would be going
 to deliver an official letter,

09:43.620 --> 09:45.940
but the letter would be 
the declaration of war.

09:45.940 --> 09:47.350
The recipient would be furious

09:47.350 --> 09:50.120
and cut down the second prince 
sent as a messenger.

09:50.120 --> 09:52.360
I believe that would be his plot.

09:53.720 --> 09:55.570
That's plausible.

09:55.930 --> 09:57.150
Prince Cloud,

09:57.570 --> 10:02.120
from this point forward, we'll be 
facing off against the prime minister.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.910
Are you really sure about this?

10:03.910 --> 10:05.450
I understand.

10:05.450 --> 10:08.750
I will save my mother and 
fight the prime minister.

10:12.090 --> 10:14.680
All right. Commence operation!

10:21.240 --> 10:26.270
My mother is held captive in Gallia Fortress 
within Prime Minister Wardack's domain.

10:26.270 --> 10:28.410
It's quite the sturdy fortress,

10:28.410 --> 10:31.980
but with Your Royal Highness's 
invisibility magic, we could infiltrate it.

10:31.980 --> 10:33.490
Target Lock-on,

10:33.490 --> 10:35.030
Soldiers in the Fortress,

10:35.030 --> 10:36.320
Activate Paralyze.

10:37.490 --> 10:39.500
Targeting complete.

10:39.500 --> 10:41.700
Activating Paralyze.

10:44.660 --> 10:47.800
I used a paralyzing spell, so they 
won't be able to move for a while.

10:47.800 --> 10:49.200
Now let's get going.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.110
Huh?

10:50.110 --> 10:52.420
If you let this bother you, 
there'll be no end to it.

10:52.420 --> 10:53.750
That's right.

10:54.680 --> 10:56.630
What's that mean?

11:00.870 --> 11:02.080
Mother!

11:03.510 --> 11:04.720
Cloud?

11:05.800 --> 11:07.060
Is that you, Cloud?

11:08.030 --> 11:09.350
Mother...

11:10.190 --> 11:11.850
Cloud!

11:21.320 --> 11:23.620
Really?! That cliché?!

11:23.620 --> 11:24.990
Come on, now, this way.

11:23.620 --> 11:24.990
Good for you.

11:24.990 --> 11:26.070
Oh, my.

11:26.070 --> 11:28.120
Rescue complete.

11:28.620 --> 11:33.330
Prince Cloud, I'm glad you've made 
the decision to fight the prime minister.

11:33.610 --> 11:36.010
Plus, now that you've earned 
the cooperation of

11:36.010 --> 11:38.380
the Belfast Kingdom and the other nations,

11:38.380 --> 11:40.760
we will have nothing to fear.

11:40.760 --> 11:44.380
<i>This brawny muscle-man is Marquis Koupe?</i>

11:44.380 --> 11:48.970
Um, while we're willing to help, we would 
rather take control without violence.

11:49.400 --> 11:52.580
In that case, restraining the prime minister

11:52.580 --> 11:55.520
and stripping Prince Zabune 
of his right to the throne

11:55.520 --> 11:57.320
will be the keys here.

11:57.320 --> 12:01.710
I don't think restraining the prime 
minister will be much of a problem.

12:02.130 --> 12:04.280
That just leaves Prince Zabune.

12:04.280 --> 12:08.240
Can we not exile him for all 
the ill deeds he's done?

12:10.180 --> 12:14.730
The prime minister has crushed 
all clear evidence of those.

12:15.100 --> 12:17.310
I suppose, worst case, 
we could threaten the king

12:17.310 --> 12:19.620
and force him to yield 
the throne to Prince Cloud...

12:19.620 --> 12:22.940
Wait, that would just make 
us look like the villains.

12:27.970 --> 12:31.560
<i>At any rate, there's nothing 
holding Prince Cloud back anymore.</i>

12:31.560 --> 12:34.890
<i>So that just leaves the question 
of how to fry them up.</i>

12:35.320 --> 12:40.860
<i>I have no intention of showing mercy 
to people who planned to enslave Sue.</i>

12:41.140 --> 12:44.070
There's Touya's evil look.

12:44.070 --> 12:47.450
He's plotting something vicious again.

12:47.450 --> 12:49.790
Oh, come on.

12:50.130 --> 12:51.320
We figured...

12:51.320 --> 12:52.580
...it was time for...

12:52.580 --> 12:54.350
...evil Touya.

12:56.000 --> 12:59.020
Queen Erya disappeared 
from Gallia Fortress?!

12:59.020 --> 13:00.270
Y-Yes.

13:00.270 --> 13:03.720
According to the messenger pigeon, 
she was taken away by Prince Cloud.

13:03.720 --> 13:05.440
That damned Cloud!

13:05.440 --> 13:08.700
He'd better not think he can get 
away with defying his master!

13:09.430 --> 13:11.100
P-Pardon me!

13:11.100 --> 13:16.990
We'll have to hurry and ask His Majesty 
to yield the throne to Prince Zabune.

13:16.990 --> 13:19.820
Then we'll have to seize 
Prince Cloud, as well.

13:19.820 --> 13:22.710
What about the war with Palouf?

13:22.710 --> 13:24.780
Unfortunately, we're putting that off.

13:24.780 --> 13:27.830
Nipping this rebellion 
in the bud comes first.

13:27.830 --> 13:28.750
Hmph.

13:28.750 --> 13:32.450
Well, at least I'll finally get to be king.

13:34.370 --> 13:37.290
Losing Queen Erya is a major blow.

13:37.290 --> 13:41.210
I should have had Zabune inherit the throne 
sooner, if this was going to happen.

13:41.580 --> 13:46.680
Though I needed the power of the king 
to keep Marquis Koupe in check...

13:46.680 --> 13:47.630
Damn it!

13:47.630 --> 13:49.670
<i>Oh? Well, now...</i>

13:50.910 --> 13:54.030
I need to have Zabune inherit the throne

13:54.030 --> 13:56.610
before word about Queen Erya 
reaches the king's ears.

13:56.610 --> 14:00.190
If I threaten Queen Erya's life, 
he's sure to agree.

14:01.450 --> 14:04.400
<i>So even the king was being 
threatened with Queen Erya?</i>

14:04.400 --> 14:08.430
What will we do with the king 
once Zabune takes the throne?

14:09.510 --> 14:11.120
We'll make him disappear.

14:11.650 --> 14:16.100
<i>Oh! Confessions of conspiracy 
to commit regicide acquired!</i>

14:16.100 --> 14:18.860
Then we'll have Cloud die, as well.

14:18.860 --> 14:22.540
We won't leave a single member 
of the royal bloodline alive.

14:23.070 --> 14:26.830
<i>Huh? But Zabune also shares the king's blood...</i>

14:28.600 --> 14:34.010
So our child will soon be this nation's king.

14:34.490 --> 14:38.480
Yeah. It'll be the birth 
of a new royal family.

14:38.480 --> 14:39.730
It can't be...

14:39.730 --> 14:43.360
Prince Zabune is the son 
of Wardack and Dacia?!

14:43.360 --> 14:46.360
Then they're trying to oust the royal family!

14:46.360 --> 14:48.160
I'm shocked.

14:48.160 --> 14:52.410
Though it also makes sense the two 
princes weren't blood-related.

14:52.410 --> 14:53.700
Indeed.

14:53.700 --> 14:58.040
Now there's no need for me 
to hesitate any longer.

14:58.550 --> 15:02.250
I will fight these traitors 
trying to take over our nation

15:02.250 --> 15:05.080
for the sake of the nation, 
my father, and my mother!

15:05.500 --> 15:08.170
Well said, Prince Cloud!

15:09.840 --> 15:12.800
Not to go add the finishing touches.

15:12.800 --> 15:15.060
Where are you planning to go?

15:15.060 --> 15:18.980
To tell the truth to the greatest victim here.

15:20.850 --> 15:24.130
The truth is, Zabune, Wardack, and Dacia are...

15:24.130 --> 15:25.190
What?!

15:37.930 --> 15:42.070
I have summoned you all here despite 
 your busy schedules for one reason.

15:42.660 --> 15:47.340
I am planning to cede the throne and retire.

15:48.840 --> 15:52.980
I would like to announce the next king now.

15:53.380 --> 15:58.110
I will yield all official duties 
to my son and retire as king.

15:58.890 --> 16:04.030
My inheritor and the next king of the Kingdom of Linhea is the first prince.

16:06.630 --> 16:12.320
The first prince, Cloud Zeph Linhea, 
will inherit my throne!

16:12.320 --> 16:13.280
What?!

16:13.280 --> 16:13.990
Wha—

16:13.990 --> 16:14.820
Huh?!

16:19.240 --> 16:21.050
Go on, Prince Cloud.

16:25.710 --> 16:27.660
Wha... Cloud!

16:28.250 --> 16:29.880
Why, you...

16:30.920 --> 16:34.470
I humbly accept this honor, Father.

16:35.110 --> 16:39.810
Henceforth, I hope to spare no effort 
in serving even more faithfully as king.

16:40.180 --> 16:42.890
Yes. I'm counting on you.

16:42.890 --> 16:44.480
Hold on a minute!

16:44.480 --> 16:46.390
What is going here?!

16:46.390 --> 16:47.440
Your Majesty!

16:47.440 --> 16:49.420
Pardon my speaking,

16:49.420 --> 16:54.630
but it is time-honored tradition for 
the first prince to inherit the throne!

16:54.630 --> 16:58.240
Even Your Majesty cannot bend that rule!

16:58.240 --> 17:01.000
Indeed. You make a good point.

17:01.730 --> 17:04.870
Which is exactly why I am 
yielding the throne to Cloud!

17:05.790 --> 17:08.030
But Zabune is the first prince!

17:08.030 --> 17:10.550
It's only proper for Zabune to become king!

17:15.910 --> 17:18.870
You speak to me of propriety, Dacia?

17:18.870 --> 17:21.640
How dare you utter such a thing?

17:23.490 --> 17:26.230
Grand Duke of Brunhild, come forward.

17:26.820 --> 17:28.560
Brunhild?

17:29.140 --> 17:30.400
Touya!

17:33.110 --> 17:37.210
What will we do with the king 
once Zabune cedes the throne?

17:38.220 --> 17:39.820
We'll make him disappear.

17:39.820 --> 17:41.530
Th-This is...

17:42.930 --> 17:48.400
So our child will soon be this nation's king.

17:48.760 --> 17:52.210
Yeah. It'll be the birth 
of a new royal family.

17:52.520 --> 17:53.600
Stop it!

17:53.600 --> 17:55.490
Stop it right this instant!

17:56.380 --> 17:58.860
Prince Zabune's father is the prime minister?

17:58.860 --> 18:01.350
So he's not even of royal blood?

18:01.350 --> 18:02.680
Wha...

18:02.680 --> 18:05.930
Your Majesty, there must be some mistake!

18:05.930 --> 18:07.850
A mistake, eh?

18:08.380 --> 18:13.070
I'm sure I must have looked 
quite the fool in your eyes.

18:13.590 --> 18:17.060
Did you laugh while I treated Zabune 
as my own son, knowing nothing,

18:17.060 --> 18:20.450
and agonized over his ill deeds?

18:22.120 --> 18:24.690
Now that Erya is safe,

18:25.160 --> 18:27.950
I have no need to hold back against you.

18:28.510 --> 18:33.000
Wardack, as of this moment, you are 
stripped of your status as prime minister!

18:36.010 --> 18:39.370
As king, I should be prioritizing 
the welfare of my people,

18:39.370 --> 18:44.090
yet I spent ten years at 
your behest to protect Erya!

18:44.530 --> 18:46.790
I will never stop regretting that!

18:47.910 --> 18:49.270
Father...

18:49.270 --> 18:53.270
Your Majesty, what will 
you do with these three?

18:54.300 --> 18:57.780
Wardack and my mother are 
the ones who plotted to kill you!

18:57.780 --> 18:58.980
Not me!

18:58.980 --> 19:00.660
I had nothing to do with it!

19:01.070 --> 19:06.270
Do you think I don't know about 
all the things you've done?

19:07.260 --> 19:10.020
By your crimes alone, you have
all earned the death penalty.

19:10.020 --> 19:11.790
You have to be kidding me!

19:11.790 --> 19:14.490
Why should I have to face 
the death penalty?!

19:14.490 --> 19:18.340
It's your turn to pay the piper 
for everything you've done!

19:18.340 --> 19:20.470
You're no longer a prince or anything else!

19:20.470 --> 19:22.050
Just a criminal!

19:22.050 --> 19:24.660
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

19:24.660 --> 19:26.340
I promise I'll kill you for this!

19:26.340 --> 19:27.610
Remember this!

19:27.610 --> 19:31.410
I'll ruin your nation and your women, too!

19:31.410 --> 19:32.280
Huh?

19:32.280 --> 19:33.710
What did you just say?

19:34.740 --> 19:36.120
Eek!

19:36.120 --> 19:37.670
Wh-What are you—

19:37.670 --> 19:40.820
You're going to ruin 
everything precious to me, right?

19:40.820 --> 19:43.620
Do you really think I would 
allow such a person to live?

19:46.270 --> 19:47.520
Don't kill me!

19:47.520 --> 19:48.700
I don't want to die!

19:48.700 --> 19:54.000
Yet you smiled as you killed plenty of 
innocent people in your town who said that.

19:54.000 --> 19:56.420
You think you deserve 
to be spared after that?

20:03.410 --> 20:04.310
Touya-dono!

20:04.310 --> 20:05.580
Are you okay?

20:10.100 --> 20:12.670
Sorry, I lost my cool a little.

20:13.100 --> 20:16.060
I apologize for overstepping my bounds.

20:18.020 --> 20:22.310
No, Zabune does need to 
pay for what he's done.

20:22.310 --> 20:24.030
I may have declared the death penalty,

20:24.030 --> 20:28.030
but I shall leave their punishment 
up to our new king, Cloud.

20:29.470 --> 20:32.290
Soldiers! Take these three to the dungeon!

20:33.440 --> 20:38.290
<i>Afterward, the new king, Cloud, reappointed 
Marquis Koupe as prime minister,</i>

20:38.810 --> 20:43.010
<i>and they purged all the merchants and 
nobles who were in cahoots with Wardack.</i>

20:43.650 --> 20:48.480
<i>While Zabune, Wardack, and Dacia 
officially received the death penalty,</i>

20:48.480 --> 20:51.540
<i>they were actually secretly sold off 
to a Sandoran slave trader.</i>

20:52.790 --> 20:55.900
Welcome to our alliance!

20:57.900 --> 21:01.350
<i>Now that matters with Linhea are settled,</i>

21:01.350 --> 21:03.600
<i>I can focus on the Frame Gears.</i>

21:03.600 --> 21:05.520
Touya!

21:08.910 --> 21:10.880
I heard from my father!

21:10.880 --> 21:14.460
He told me you took down that 
stupid prince for my sake!

21:14.460 --> 21:17.290
Yeah, I guess I took him down.

21:17.290 --> 21:19.750
You really are the best!

21:19.750 --> 21:21.880
You're the best husband!

21:22.410 --> 21:26.840
It's true that I didn't want to 
hand you over to that stupid prince,

21:26.840 --> 21:28.850
but I don't know about "husband."

21:28.850 --> 21:33.340
My father told me you accepted it, though.

21:33.340 --> 21:35.940
Or am I not good enough?

21:39.550 --> 21:42.390
<i>Well, the others already 
said they didn't mind...</i>

21:42.390 --> 21:45.100
<i>Am I just getting carried along 
on the current here?!</i>

21:48.550 --> 21:50.200
<i>No, that's not true.</i>

21:50.200 --> 21:53.170
<i>I thought of her as a 
little sister up until now,</i>

21:53.170 --> 21:57.920
<i>but Sue is still a precious woman 
that I want to protect.</i>

22:00.420 --> 22:01.920
Uh...

22:01.920 --> 22:06.810
I won't be marrying you until 
I turn 18, just like everyone else.

22:06.810 --> 22:08.010
Are you still okay with that?

22:09.700 --> 22:11.230
Of course that's fine!

22:11.230 --> 22:12.950
Thank you, Touya!

22:15.300 --> 22:17.860
<i>I need to make her happy, too.</i>

22:30.860 --> 22:33.880
Every day is bittersweet

22:33.880 --> 22:36.290
(Bubbly bubbly)

22:36.290 --> 22:41.760
I might still blush when 
your eyes are close up

22:42.950 --> 22:47.370
Our love affair goes around with 
the 1, 2, 3 beat of I, My, Me, Mine

22:47.370 --> 22:50.240
But "Look solely at me"

22:50.610 --> 22:56.370
Is something I can't say; 
I want you to notice my jealousy

22:57.650 --> 23:00.300
My hero glimpsed through a lens

23:00.300 --> 23:04.100
I want you to take everything, 
even your flawed kindness

23:04.100 --> 23:06.810
And fill me up with goodness even more

23:06.810 --> 23:09.480
(even more)

23:09.480 --> 23:12.320
Until I burst

23:12.320 --> 23:17.360
My heart races and aches deep 
within because I love you

23:17.360 --> 23:22.810
My love is rapidly rising, 
but, but, but, but

23:22.810 --> 23:26.600
I can't help that we're in another world

23:26.600 --> 23:31.690
Let's sing about this joyous occasion 
illuminated by the brilliant sun!

23:31.690 --> 23:33.720
"Together forever!"

23:33.720 --> 23:38.010
I may not be much, but I want you 
to hug me from time to time,

23:38.010 --> 23:39.610
And if you're far away, that's okey-dokey

23:39.610 --> 23:42.100
We'll live happily ever after!
